   cursor position. This is generally used once a line such as the
   within the example below.

EXAMPLE:


      DMsg("Enter your name =>");
      DotIt(18);
      
      /* Prompt calls etc.. */

      .

      .

      /* results in (minus speechmarks) */

      "Enter your name =>                 ."


