25.	HASEXPIRED

 NAME:

   HasExpired()

FUNCTION:

   This will allow you to know if the users account has come up for
   review or not. You should then take actions if this is true,
   generally this would be used within the interlog.apt (or module)
   file, giving some indication that he has come up for review before
   giving him a chance to page for the sysop and/or leave feedback
   before he is dropped off.

