78.	MOVEUSER

 NAME:

    Success = MoveUser(accountname,kind)(a0,d0)

FUNCTION:

    Moves a user account, whose name is supplied, to one of three
    possible directories: Users, NewUsers/ , and Review/

EXAMPLE:

    if(HasExpired())
    {
      MoveUser(udat->us_name,USER_REVIEW);
      ShowTpl("review/review");
      DropLine();
    }

NOTE:

   Care should be taken when moving a user who might be online. It
   is generally recommended that users who are online are only moved
   as soon as they have entered their names and are inside the
   actual interlog portion of the system, to which the line should
   be dropped soon after.

RETURNS:

   Success is TRUE.


79.	GETUSERFROMDIR

 NAME:

    AccountVariable = GetUserFromDir(Accountname,DestinationString)(a0,a1)

FUNCTION:

    Finds out which directory a given user is actually being contained
    within. Generally the string that is placed in "Destination" is
